---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { LEGAL, PAGES } from "../legal";
---

<LegalLayout
  lang="en"
  page="legal"
  title="Legal notice"
  description="Who publishes Snap2Link, who hosts it, and how to report content."
>
  <h2>Publisher</h2>
  <p>
    Snap2Link is published by {LEGAL.publisher}, {LEGAL.based.en}, who is also responsible for its
    content. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.contact}`}>{LEGAL.contact}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Host</h2>
  <p>
    The website and Snap2Link hosting run on the infrastructure of:<br />
    {LEGAL.host.name}<br />
    {LEGAL.host.address}
  </p>

  <h2 id="report">Report content</h2>
  <p>
    To report a capture, write to <a href={`mailto:${LEGAL.abuse}`}>{LEGAL.abuse}</a>. This is also
    our point of contact for authorities and for users of the service. We read messages in French
    and English. Please include:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>the full link to the capture;</li>
    <li>why you believe it is illegal, or which rule it breaks;</li>
    <li>your name and email address, unless you are reporting child sexual abuse material;</li>
    <li>a statement that your report is accurate and made in good faith.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We confirm receipt, act as quickly as we can, and tell you what we decided. Links expire after
    24 to 48 hours, so please write soon, and don't attach the image.
  </p>
  <p>
    For child sexual abuse material or an immediate danger, also contact the police or your
    national hotline, listed by <a href="https://www.inhope.org/EN">INHOPE</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    Snap2Link's source code is under the
    <a href="https://github.com/amys94fr/Snap2Link/blob/main/LICENSE">MIT license</a>. Google Drive,
    Cloudflare, GitHub and other names belong to their owners.
  </p>
  <p>
    See also the <a href={PAGES.en.privacy}>privacy policy</a> and the
    <a href={PAGES.en.terms}>terms of use</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
